# Pin script line endings regardless of core.autocrlf: release assets are
# attached from a working tree, and bash rejects CRLF while cmd misreads LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Batch files are shipped to Windows users and run by cmd.exe. Pin them to CRLF
# in every checkout, rather than trusting the cloning client's core.autocrlf:
# the installer clones with the git inside the conda environment, not with Git
# for Windows, and its defaults are not ours to assume.
*.bat text eol=crlf
